									<div class="site-panel__cafeinfo-description" data-js="site-panel__cafeinfo-description">

						<div class="site-panel__cafeinfo-summary" id="site-panel__cafeinfo-summary" data-js="site-panel__cafeinfo-summary" aria-hidden="true">
							<p>Located on the&nbsp;first floor of Buntrock Commons, The Cage offers&nbsp;various made-to-order menu options along with a variety of&nbsp;healthy, freshly-made grab and go items. Enjoy fair trade organic Peace coffee, house-made bakery items, multiple flavors of ice cream, and a vast array of bottled beverages.</p>
						</div>

