<ul>
<li>Order 24 hours in advance.</li>
<li>Pick-up in Stav between 2:00 p.m. &#8211; 7:00 p.m. the day before you need your bag lunch. <em>If closed, please ask for a manager.</em></li>
<li>Bag Lunch orders will take your lunch swipe for the day(s) that you have requested on the form.</li>
</ul>
<p><a class="c-btn-text" href="https://stolaf.cafebonappetit.com/bag-lunch/">ORDER NOW</a></p>

